1
00:00:00,073 --> 00:00:03,339
Belanda resmi mengembalikan
berlian Sultan Banjar...

2
00:00:03,339 --> 00:00:05,358
tapi kepala panglima ini,

3
00:00:05,358 --> 00:00:06,055
belum.

4
00:00:06,055 --> 00:00:07,642
Namanya Demang Lehman,

5
00:00:07,642 --> 00:00:09,110
panglima Perang Banjar,

6
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:10,927
seperjuangan Pangeran Antasari.

7
00:00:10,927 --> 00:00:12,119
Ia ditangkap...

8
00:00:12,119 --> 00:00:13,915
lalu digantung di Martapura.

9
00:00:13,915 --> 00:00:15,945
Kepalanya dibawa ke Belanda...

10
00:00:15,945 --> 00:00:18,468
tercatat jadi koleksi
museum anatomi Leiden.

11
00:00:18,468 --> 00:00:19,514
Awal Oktober,

12
00:00:19,514 --> 00:00:21,734
Gubernur Kalimantan
Selatan memintanya pulang.

13
00:00:21,734 --> 00:00:22,642
Padahal,

14
00:00:22,642 --> 00:00:25,468
Belanda pernah memulangkan
kepala seorang raja Ghana...

15
00:00:25,468 --> 00:00:26,587
dari Leiden juga.

16
00:00:26,587 --> 00:00:27,651
Kirim ke temanmu,

17
00:00:27,651 --> 00:00:29,986
supaya beliau tidak dilupakan!
